WEBVTT

01:38.080 --> 01:41.710
EPISODE 11: TIAN FU'S RELIC

01:38.080 --> 01:39.900
This is gonna be fun.

01:40.590 --> 01:42.410
Yeah, sure is.

01:42.410 --> 01:43.620
Wanna give it a go?

01:44.070 --> 01:46.310
Right, then. Let's play.

01:51.340 --> 01:53.160
Would you hurry it up?

01:54.140 --> 01:55.730
Damn, I lost.

01:55.730 --> 01:56.880
Okay, here goes!

01:56.880 --> 01:58.260
That's impossible!

02:00.300 --> 02:03.270
Nothing impossible about it.
You just suck.

02:03.620 --> 02:07.060
No one just keeps getting
perfect cards like that!

02:07.060 --> 02:08.060
Hey.

02:08.320 --> 02:12.930
If you're done, get lost. 
I want to play a round, too.

02:12.930 --> 02:14.030
What'd you say?!

02:17.310 --> 02:19.540
Tsk, what a rotten day.

02:19.540 --> 02:22.120
Who's this? Never seen you here before.

02:22.590 --> 02:24.210
You'll know me soon enough.

02:25.490 --> 02:26.540
Sit down.

02:29.870 --> 02:30.800
Straight.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.050
Four twos.

02:32.050 --> 02:33.300
Three aces.

02:35.100 --> 02:37.050
Royal flush.

02:37.050 --> 02:40.390
Impossible! How can this be?

02:48.120 --> 02:50.900
The "Blessed Coin from 
the Goddess of Fortune."

02:51.280 --> 02:55.130
A relic born from all the coins 
people threw for good luck.

02:56.310 --> 02:57.750
H-How did you—

02:57.750 --> 03:00.410
You used this to cheat so 
you'd always get good cards.

03:00.850 --> 03:02.910
Even so, it's only Grade C,

03:03.800 --> 03:08.180
while you're all being enveloped 
in Grade SS Bankruptcy aura.

03:10.530 --> 03:12.670
Are you sure this is all right?

03:13.450 --> 03:14.840
Ms. Holton!

03:15.540 --> 03:17.840
<i>She's gotten much better 
at controlling the relic.</i>

03:18.910 --> 03:22.430
<i>Now that everyone except Kotaro 
and me is plagued by bad luck,</i>

03:22.430 --> 03:25.680
<i>all the good cards can 
only end up with me.</i>

03:27.600 --> 03:29.190
Take it and get lost.

03:29.190 --> 03:30.220
That's not enough.

03:30.220 --> 03:32.370
What? This is exactly—

03:32.370 --> 03:34.540
And what about your 
punishment for cheating?

03:34.540 --> 03:36.610
One million dollars per person.

03:37.350 --> 03:39.570
Say what?! You can't just—

03:42.720 --> 03:47.370
You didn't think you'd get 
away scot-free, did you?

03:47.890 --> 03:51.590
Generous as I am, I'll accept 
forms of payment other than cash.

03:52.350 --> 03:55.790
Give me Tian Fu's Relic, 
the one used to lure the children.

03:56.300 --> 03:57.590
Wh-What?!

03:57.990 --> 04:02.220
Then tell me exactly 
what Kiera is doing here.

04:02.830 --> 04:03.850
You bastard...

04:03.850 --> 04:07.140
Are you serious? 
That's why you approached us?

04:07.140 --> 04:09.130
You won't get a single word—

04:10.590 --> 04:12.060
My gut...

04:12.950 --> 04:14.720
What's wrong, Mary?!

04:19.410 --> 04:22.660
<i>Uh-oh. Did I go too far?</i>

04:25.310 --> 04:27.090
M-Ms. Holton!

04:27.090 --> 04:28.410
Someone's screaming!

04:31.490 --> 04:32.670
Ms. Holton...

04:35.250 --> 04:36.260
Stop!

04:36.640 --> 04:38.970
I'll talk! Just make it stop!

04:39.550 --> 04:42.340
<i>It's working, though, 
so I guess it's all good.</i>

04:43.080 --> 04:45.450
Why didn't you say so sooner? 
I'm all ears.

04:45.450 --> 04:49.060
To the north! There's a tomb 
in the forest to the north!

04:49.460 --> 04:54.440
Tian Fu's relic is there, too...
I don't know any more about...

04:55.630 --> 04:57.400
Hurry! It's Ms. Holton!

04:57.400 --> 04:58.410
What?

05:04.060 --> 05:06.370
Where are you, Irene-san? Answer me!

05:09.450 --> 05:13.460
<i>Damn it, where did she go? 
This has to be the relic's risk.</i>

05:13.460 --> 05:17.530
<i>Irene isn't used to handling relics.
I shouldn't have given her this task.</i>

05:20.780 --> 05:23.140
<i>Running around blindly 
won't get me anywhere.</i>

05:23.910 --> 05:25.120
<i>Think.</i>

05:26.730 --> 05:29.640
<i>I only need to track 
the aura of Irene's relic.</i>

05:40.940 --> 05:41.990
<i>Found her!</i>

05:42.310 --> 05:44.870
<i>Over there? She's close!</i>

05:56.740 --> 06:00.240
Why'd she come here instead of the hotel?

06:13.700 --> 06:16.230
Oh, Ryoga-san...

06:16.230 --> 06:17.690
Oh, come on.

06:19.590 --> 06:22.190
It really is you...

06:22.810 --> 06:23.990
You must have—

06:26.030 --> 06:27.320
What are you doing?

06:34.450 --> 06:38.130
<i>I-Is this part of the risk, too?</i>

07:09.280 --> 07:11.080
THIS TIME, SHE WAS CRAVING YOUR LIPS.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.580
Yeah, I figured that out, thanks!

07:13.580 --> 07:17.860
You were supposed to warn me 
beforehand, you damned crow!

07:22.640 --> 07:24.620
A Holton private jet?

07:24.620 --> 07:29.560
Yes. It appears someone from 
the family is working with them.

07:30.000 --> 07:33.060
The private jet is currently 
headed for Bent.

07:33.390 --> 07:35.890
The Holtons and Bent...

07:35.890 --> 07:37.570
How amusing.

07:47.910 --> 07:50.160
WARNING
YOU ARE ENTERING AN AREA ACCESSIBLE ONLY TO CHILDREN.

07:50.160 --> 07:52.760
<i>Only children are allowed in...</i>

07:52.760 --> 07:55.700
<i>So Tian Fu's Relic really is here.</i>

07:55.700 --> 07:59.420
THIS TOMB HAS BEEN CONQUERED.
THE RELIC ALREADY HAS AN OWNER.

07:59.420 --> 08:03.720
<i>Then why wasn't the tomb sealed?</i>

08:03.720 --> 08:05.380
<i>What is Kiera planning?</i>

08:06.160 --> 08:08.390
Give me the sweet potato relic.

08:08.740 --> 08:11.930
What? The sweet potato? Don't tell me...

08:13.740 --> 08:16.190
No! I won't! I don't want to!

08:16.190 --> 08:17.440
You're so cruel!

08:23.830 --> 08:25.660
Ugh, that hurt.

08:25.660 --> 08:29.380
Jeez, Boss, can't we use the 
normal entrance for once?

08:29.380 --> 08:31.680
I need a hundred lives 
just to survive next to you!

08:33.120 --> 08:36.620
THIS TOMB HAS BEEN CONQUERED BY HUMANS.
HUMAN ITEMS CAN THEREFORE BE USED.

08:36.910 --> 08:39.630
Well, I'll be.

08:40.260 --> 08:41.940
I even have service.

08:41.940 --> 08:43.130
B-Boss.

08:43.830 --> 08:45.280
L-Look...

08:50.550 --> 08:53.700
Such a huge field underground.

08:53.700 --> 08:55.520
And the children...

08:55.520 --> 09:00.400
That explosion just now 
didn't even faze them.

09:00.760 --> 09:03.480
Are they under hypnosis?

09:03.960 --> 09:06.120
It's definitely strange.

09:06.990 --> 09:09.610
THE CHILDREN ARE CONTROLLED 
BY TIAN FU'S RELIC.

09:09.610 --> 09:11.360
THEY HARVEST TEA LEAVES AT ITS COMMAND.

09:14.030 --> 09:17.370
THEY HAVE BEEN ENDOWED WITH 
THE STRENGTH OF A MINOTAUR.

09:17.580 --> 09:20.500
THE TEA'S AROMA CAN BRING THE DEAD BACK TO LIFE, 
AND THE EUPHORIA IT BRINGS IS UNFORGETTABLE .

09:20.950 --> 09:23.490
<i>Damn it. Just as I expected...</i>

09:23.490 --> 09:27.590
<i>The Minotaur: a creature with 
a human body and a bull's head.</i>

09:27.590 --> 09:29.510
<i>That can only mean...</i>

09:30.110 --> 09:33.360
This tea field was created 
by Shennong's Relic.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.010
"Shennong"?

09:35.440 --> 09:37.820
As the inventor of 
the first farming tools,

09:37.820 --> 09:40.000
he is said to have taught 
mankind agriculture.

09:40.900 --> 09:45.280
He discovered which plants were 
beneficial and which were poisonous,

09:45.280 --> 09:49.430
and legend says he used tea leaves 
to purge poison from his body.

09:50.400 --> 09:52.740
What about Tian Fu's Relic?

09:53.230 --> 09:55.490
It must be around here somewhere, too.

09:56.030 --> 10:00.120
When Kiera excavated this tomb,
all she found was the tea field.

10:00.990 --> 10:05.260
She knew the relic had created it,
so she decided to harvest it.

10:06.040 --> 10:10.110
However, only children 
can enter this tomb.

10:10.110 --> 10:14.110
So she used Tian Fu's Relic to turn 
the local children into workers.

10:16.020 --> 10:20.810
All right! Let's bag two relics today.

10:21.180 --> 10:23.810
Huh? Ryoga-san, the children...

10:34.490 --> 10:35.600
Ms. Holton!

10:37.820 --> 10:39.930
Rope, you're up! Bind them!

10:40.620 --> 10:42.140
Got it!

10:43.410 --> 10:45.050
Let's play!

10:47.150 --> 10:49.960
Let's play! Let's play!

10:50.410 --> 10:52.310
Phew, we're still alive!

10:52.310 --> 10:53.470
Everything okay over there?

10:53.470 --> 10:55.470
Yes, everything's fine.

10:56.720 --> 10:59.400
<i>There you are, relic.</i>

10:59.400 --> 11:03.160
<i>I appreciate you giving 
off that much aura.</i>

11:12.180 --> 11:15.280
Ow, ow, ow! Get it off of me!

11:15.280 --> 11:17.840
Oh? Where's that voice coming from?

11:17.840 --> 11:19.780
Oh, so that's where you were hiding.

11:21.340 --> 11:24.000
H-How the hell did you spot me?

11:24.000 --> 11:27.050
You're the one who was 
emitting so much aura.

11:27.050 --> 11:28.790
Damn it!

11:29.730 --> 11:31.860
What kind of guy are you?!

11:33.270 --> 11:35.280
And what's with these cheap tricks?

11:35.800 --> 11:39.800
Easy now. I won't hurt you, so calm down.

11:41.000 --> 11:42.140
Really?

11:42.140 --> 11:44.010
Why would I lie?

11:44.010 --> 11:46.790
So, care to make a deal with us?

11:46.790 --> 11:49.340
I know how much you love money.

11:49.340 --> 11:52.570
How much do I have to pay to buy you?

11:52.570 --> 11:56.570
Uh, Boss, why are you 
negotiating with a worm?

11:57.310 --> 12:01.260
Like Tian Fu's Relic, this one 
is an extortion-type relic.

12:01.260 --> 12:04.240
It demands money for its service.

12:04.240 --> 12:05.910
What? Money?!

12:07.060 --> 12:09.540
You're a man I can do business with.

12:09.540 --> 12:13.420
But don't get cocky before 
you even know how much I...

12:13.420 --> 12:15.150
Two billion dollars.

12:15.150 --> 12:17.770
What?! T-Two billion?!

12:17.770 --> 12:18.930
That much?!

12:18.930 --> 12:22.430
Oh, very nice! It's real cash!

12:22.430 --> 12:24.770
But that's not nearly... eh?

12:25.150 --> 12:28.020
Here's another two billion. 
Do we have a deal?

12:30.140 --> 12:31.980
It's raining money!

12:31.980 --> 12:34.360
I guess we have a contract now.

12:34.360 --> 12:37.150
Nope! You'll have to do 
much better than that.

12:38.260 --> 12:41.990
My current owner's down payment 
was considerably higher.

12:42.670 --> 12:46.500
<i>Just how much cash did Kiera give him?</i>

12:46.500 --> 12:50.460
<i>I gave him all the money I prepared 
plus my reserves, jewelry,</i>

12:50.460 --> 12:53.500
<i>even my watch—everything 
I had that was worth money.</i>

12:53.500 --> 12:55.070
Here you go!

12:54.110 --> 12:56.670
<i>The Holtons contributed a property, too.</i>

12:58.180 --> 13:01.860
My new owner is far richer than he looks!

12:58.970 --> 13:02.840
THE

12:59.470 --> 13:02.840
DEAL

12:59.970 --> 13:02.840
IS

13:00.470 --> 13:02.840
DONE

13:03.340 --> 13:05.390
So? What can I do for you?

13:05.680 --> 13:08.220
Hey! What are you doing?!

13:09.300 --> 13:12.410
You'd better be ready to 
work hard for all that money.

13:12.800 --> 13:14.150
My first command:

13:14.490 --> 13:18.060
Have the children pack up all 
the tea leaves and saplings.

13:18.060 --> 13:19.650
Then we're getting out of here.

13:19.650 --> 13:22.820
Huh? That'll make Shennong's Relic angry.

13:22.820 --> 13:24.830
I'll take care of that.

13:24.830 --> 13:28.700
All right. That'll cost you 
another 70 million.

13:28.700 --> 13:30.330
You want even more money?!

13:30.330 --> 13:32.450
What you paid before was 
only the down payment.

13:32.450 --> 13:34.840
Every command costs extra.

13:34.840 --> 13:38.340
You'll get your money when we're 
out of here! Shut up and get to work!

13:39.760 --> 13:42.970
I understand, Master! 
Please stop shaking me!

13:43.610 --> 13:45.260
You scoundrels!

13:45.260 --> 13:48.810
How dare you abandon 
my field and try to escape?

13:49.220 --> 13:51.160
<i>There he is! Shennong!</i>

13:51.160 --> 13:54.980
Worm, lead my people and 
the children to the exit.

13:55.490 --> 13:57.900
You really will pay me later, won't you?

13:57.900 --> 14:01.280
Would you rather I turn you 
into an earthworm shake?

14:02.150 --> 14:06.190
Aw, I was just kidding. 
I'll show them the shortcut.

14:06.840 --> 14:09.090
Here. You all go on ahead.

14:09.090 --> 14:10.750
A-And what about you?

14:11.320 --> 14:15.250
Don't worry. I'll be right behind you 
once I have Shennong's Relic.

14:16.180 --> 14:18.330
You think you can claim me?

14:25.720 --> 14:26.890
What's your problem?!

14:29.470 --> 14:30.930
Struggle all you want.

14:30.930 --> 14:34.640
You'll pay for taking my workers from me!

14:34.640 --> 14:38.220
I'll drag you down into 
the deepest depths of hell!

14:41.030 --> 14:42.570
Going out with a bang, aren't you?

14:43.080 --> 14:44.060
Ryoga-san!

15:06.300 --> 15:07.640
Ryoga-san!

15:06.300 --> 15:07.640
Boss!

15:09.800 --> 15:11.930
The tremors are getting stronger!

15:12.370 --> 15:13.750
We have to get out of here!

15:30.760 --> 15:32.520
Hey! Handle with care!

15:32.520 --> 15:37.140
Hmph! I don't want to hear that 
from the guy who ruined my field!

15:37.140 --> 15:40.540
You enticed the worm into betraying me.

15:41.420 --> 15:44.470
<i>So it was disguised as a tea bush.</i>

15:45.350 --> 15:49.860
<i>This is risky. There's a good 
chance Shennong is God Grade.</i>

15:50.290 --> 15:52.620
<i>If my dominance isn't enough, then...</i>

15:54.810 --> 16:00.030
Oh? You're putting your weapon 
away? Giving up already?

16:00.030 --> 16:02.020
No, I just want to try something.

16:02.020 --> 16:05.320
Try what? What are you talking about?

16:05.320 --> 16:09.280
Looks like there's no way out of here.

16:09.280 --> 16:14.880
But if the owner of this tomb were 
to die, perhaps one would open?

16:15.330 --> 16:16.290
What?

16:16.870 --> 16:19.700
"First Embers of Homo Erectus."

16:19.700 --> 16:22.790
A Grade D relic I swiped from the CIA.

16:23.360 --> 16:26.560
Y-You're not planning to 
blow yourself up, are you?!

16:26.560 --> 16:29.970
There just happens to be 
plenty of firewood here.

16:29.970 --> 16:33.510
One spark and everything 
goes up in flames.

16:33.510 --> 16:36.170
You idiot! If you do that, you'll also—

16:36.170 --> 16:39.530
Unfortunately for you, 
I'm pretty hard to kill.

16:39.960 --> 16:42.150
Unleash your full power!

16:42.150 --> 16:45.570
Ow, that hurts! You're going 
to break me! Stop!

16:45.880 --> 16:48.320
Have you lost your mind?!

16:49.230 --> 16:51.780
I won't let you get away with this!

16:56.670 --> 16:58.750
Set everything ablaze!

17:08.600 --> 17:10.800
Hurry! It's a rockslide!

17:15.920 --> 17:17.640
No! Ryoga-san!

17:16.560 --> 17:17.640
Boss!

17:23.240 --> 17:24.680
No...

17:28.170 --> 17:29.800
This can't be real...

17:38.160 --> 17:40.180
Damn, what a mess.

17:46.620 --> 17:49.900
Why the long faces? Did somebody die?

17:52.990 --> 17:54.180
Ryoga-san!

17:54.670 --> 17:58.560
We thought you were dead, Boss!

17:58.920 --> 18:00.950
Why would I be dead?

18:00.950 --> 18:03.060
I blew up the tomb myself.

18:03.880 --> 18:05.440
For crying out loud...

18:07.010 --> 18:09.680
Thank goodness you're all right!

18:09.680 --> 18:12.040
Kotaro-san was so worried.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.160
That's right!

18:13.160 --> 18:16.130
Wait, I mean... of course I was worried!

18:16.130 --> 18:18.080
You're my employer, after all.

18:18.080 --> 18:21.700
If something happens to you, 
I lose my job!

18:21.700 --> 18:24.720
Of course I don't wanna lose my job, so—

18:23.990 --> 18:25.440
That works out nicely.

18:26.300 --> 18:28.600
You were afraid for your job?

18:28.600 --> 18:32.130
Then you'll be glad there's 
more work waiting for you now.

18:32.610 --> 18:35.280
B-Boss, what is all this?

18:35.670 --> 18:36.640
You didn't...

18:36.640 --> 18:40.140
Shennong's Relic. 
I had to burn that nuisance.

18:40.140 --> 18:41.720
How can this be?

18:40.600 --> 18:44.650
Oh, and the flint relic 
needs to be repaired, too.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.260
Why did this happen?

18:45.100 --> 18:47.050
I can't repair this...

18:47.050 --> 18:48.110
What?

18:48.610 --> 18:51.270
Did you just say you can't repair them?

18:51.270 --> 18:54.110
No, I can! I'll fix them!

18:55.170 --> 18:57.120
<i>I shouldn't have celebrated...</i>

19:06.630 --> 19:10.740
Ah, wonderful. Simply fantastic.

19:10.740 --> 19:13.340
Yes, that's it. Keep it up.

19:13.740 --> 19:17.080
I can't believe life has 
reduced me to a gardener...

19:14.360 --> 19:17.390
Oh, I feel like I'm dreaming...

19:17.080 --> 19:19.410
No, I'm more like a butler to a tree.

19:19.410 --> 19:21.140
When will this end?

19:22.360 --> 19:23.400
Tsk...

19:25.140 --> 19:26.520
GORIKI RYOGA

19:28.650 --> 19:30.540
Hello, Boss?

19:30.540 --> 19:33.280
It's been a while. What's up?

19:33.620 --> 19:35.240
New York?

19:35.240 --> 19:38.780
Yes, sure. Tomorrow? Okay, got it.

19:38.780 --> 19:40.620
Was that the boss?

19:41.700 --> 19:43.230
Pack your things.

19:43.990 --> 19:46.070
We finally get to go out again.

19:48.200 --> 19:49.630
Boss.

19:49.630 --> 19:51.000
Boss!

19:51.960 --> 19:54.010
Boss!

19:56.490 --> 19:58.270
Are we there yet?

19:58.270 --> 20:00.020
I'm sorry.

20:00.020 --> 20:04.760
We're still on the way, but 
I suddenly can't reach my family.

20:05.430 --> 20:09.140
It's one thing that our driver isn't 
answering, but even George won't pick up.

20:09.140 --> 20:10.480
I'm a little worried.

20:12.030 --> 20:15.640
There's no need to worry. 
We're almost there.

20:15.640 --> 20:18.040
We'll be able to heal your parents soon.

20:18.990 --> 20:20.990
HEAD GARDENER

20:20.120 --> 20:20.990
Noboru?

20:22.530 --> 20:23.230
Yes?

20:23.230 --> 20:28.350
<i>Boss, we have a problem! 
Some men are after us!</i>

20:28.350 --> 20:29.440
You're being followed?

20:29.440 --> 20:31.440
<i>I think they're after the tree!</i>

20:31.440 --> 20:36.010
<i>I thought Kiera seemed too quiet.
So she's been investigating me.</i>

20:36.010 --> 20:39.510
We're changing the meeting point. 
Make sure you lose them.

20:39.510 --> 20:43.650
Don't get caught, or I'll kill you myself.

20:43.650 --> 20:45.350
<i>What?! But—</i>

20:46.110 --> 20:49.850
Is there a problem with your people?

20:50.520 --> 20:53.620
Don't worry. They can 
take care of themselves.

20:54.340 --> 20:56.400
Could you drive a little faster?

20:56.400 --> 21:00.530
Boss, the road is completely jammed.

21:01.530 --> 21:05.440
Something must be going on.
It's not usually this bad...

21:06.620 --> 21:07.910
Was that an accident?

21:09.530 --> 21:12.060
If anything happens to Ryoga-san's people,

21:12.060 --> 21:16.090
we'll lose the healing relic, 
and my parents will...

21:17.300 --> 21:19.720
Irene-san! Keep it together!

21:27.620 --> 21:30.610
Mission accomplished, Boss!
